{"updated":"2026-11-25T01:13:57.838Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DgGtI_0gCu9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgGtI_0gCu9","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini Carbon high","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:49:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgGoLrPkzmd","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgGoLrPkzmd","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini額度又重置了\npro用戶也能使用Carbon了\n現在黑五年訂閱半價一個月不到300元\n真的訂閱起來","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:05:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DgIHqQXkwzW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgIHqQXkwzW","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"Dcard 上有人問：\n「你熟悉教育現場嗎？為什麼支持雙導師制？」\n\n你們覺得呢？底下留言告訴小編👇","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:00:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgIHrruE8jS","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgIHrruE8jS","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"年輕人都在這裡等你破圈\n馬上到 Dcard 為你支持的候選人發聲 👉  dcard.link/zbgDq…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:00:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgIHtfKEwSq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgIHtfKEwSq","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨ #臺北 你熟悉教育現場嗎？為什麼支持雙導師制？✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多六都市長大選的討論","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:00:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgIAx0-EvSc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgIAx0-EvSc","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"當黃仁勳回歸 各種人的反應be like：\n\n1.我也太雖 今天全認賠賣了\n2.看盤看著看著天花板就被突破了\n3.真是振奮仁勳\n4.就說他是去玩 GTA6 你不信","timestamp":"2026-11-24T13:00:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":16,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgIAy-gknlg","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgIAy-gknlg","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"（以上反應全取自本篇卡友留言💭）原文來自✨黃仁勳回歸啦，爸爸您回來了✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-24T13:00:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgH56ZRDQD-","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgH56ZRDQD-","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家工作到現在 有哪個星座讓你留下職場陰影？","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:00:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":12,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":16,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgH57mTDW9i","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgH57mTDW9i","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨職場上有沒有哪個星座，是你真的覺得很難相處的？✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:00:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DgJRROIE4HS","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgJRROIE4HS","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"同一張 RTX 5060 Ti，跑 4-bit 的 Qwen3-4B，軟體一換，短序列解碼就能差多少？開發者在 Linux 上用 MLX 搭配 Vulkan，測到每秒 124 個 token。同卡的 llama.cpp CUDA 約 101 個。這組自測差距，來自一個容易被忽略的 GPU 同步細節。\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-25T00:43:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T09:14:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgJRSJ-k5FP","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgJRSJ-k5FP","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-25T00:43:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T09:14:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgIeetIipko","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgIeetIipko","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"「Jensen's back!」擲硬幣做空美股，結果遇到黃仁勳回歸慘賠光\n\n網紅交易員 Togi 擲硬幣決定把 40 萬美元全押做空美股，直播時看著帳戶 10 秒內少了 20 多萬，最後直播畫面只剩 5.8 萬。他還說自己問過 Claude，得到的回答是「除非黃仁勳今早回來」。\n\n片中金額為直播畫面數字，實際虧損未公開結算。你覺得是運氣太差，還是本來就不該這樣玩？","timestamp":"2026-11-24T17:20:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":28,"replies":4,"reposts":2,"shares":51},"score":42,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T09:14:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgId5DMkwmx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgId5DMkwmx","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"有網友整理了落井下石，看風向不對又改口的媒體清單\njensen-in-distress-tw-media-watch.pages.…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T17:14:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T09:14:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgH9drAk_G2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgH9drAk_G2","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:31:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgH9dIgE719","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgH9dIgE719","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"看見主機板背面那個紫綠圓孔，還記得它接什麼嗎？華碩 Z890 Apex 至今仍保留一個 PS/2 鍵盤滑鼠共用埠。從當年用顏色分辨鍵盤與滑鼠，到現在拿來做超頻除錯或銜接舊周邊，這個接頭的用途其實變了不少。\n\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:31:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgHo2odFJnU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHo2odFJnU","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:30:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgHo2FRFOLK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHo2FRFOLK","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"同一副 AirPods 用了幾年，你知道自己累積聽了多久嗎？PodHours 能把 Apple「健康」匯出的紀錄整理成每副耳機的聆聽時數、常用時段和平均音量。工具標示在瀏覽器內解析檔案，參加排行榜才會上傳聆聽紀錄。\n\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:30:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgHgC2Civ3O","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHgC2Civ3O","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"「是我說服輝達董事會的」川普打電話上 CNBC 講了 50 分鐘\n\n一週半前董事會還說「門都沒有」，川普說是股價「跌了 50%」讓董事會好做決定（CNBC 報導實際約 25%）。他還說失去黃仁勳才是更大的威脅、想像中國會請他去掌管華為。被問政府要不要入股輝達，他說「我不想以內線交易告政府」，而他的投資帳戶 9 月才買過輝達。你覺得這是救了輝達，還是政府管太多？","timestamp":"2026-11-24T08:14:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":16,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgHUhr2FIkG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHUhr2FIkG","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T06:33:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgHUhOKlMkC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHUhOKlMkC","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"入門電腦好不容易普及 16GB，現在又可能看到 8GB 機型變多。華碩在法說會表示，記憶體漲價難以全數反映在售價上，部分中低階產品可能會調整規格。常開多個分頁、邊視訊邊工作的話，選購前可以先看看容量差在哪。\n\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-24T06:33:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"DgHFNTao_cC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgHFNTao_cC","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"可喜可賀🔥🔥\n\nAI懶人報拆解課程，上線五天突破30人付費支持了🥹 超過13萬台幣進帳，也有很多人給我鼓勵與五星好評，還是一樣，感恩的心♥️，謝謝大家的喜歡，對我來說把自己的流程分享出來包裝成數位產品，本身就是一種新鮮的學習體驗，賺多少錢我並不是太在意，但看到自己的內容有人願意付費支持，能幫助到有需要的人，也走了一趟AI課程從規劃，製作，優化，上架，行銷的過程，我自己才是受惠最多的人🫶\n\n這幾天帶家人來日本玩，好好放鬆一下，也恭喜老黃王者歸來，太神啦!!","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:19:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":134,"replies":19,"reposts":5,"shares":38},"score":187,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DgIQ_ORH7xK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgIQ_ORH7xK","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"MCP 之亂\nCanva 也推出 MCP 了！\n\n雖然 可能 已經有不少人沒在用 Canva \n但這次推出還是蠻轟動的\n\n也就是說以前存在 Canva 的很多模板\n現在都能交給 Claude 直接做編輯跟調整\n兩者合併能提高不少產圖的美感跟效率\n\n像是你覺得 Claude 做的圖有點怪\n就能自己打開 Canva 微調一下位置跟改字\n能節省 token 又非常省時\n再請 Claude 記下跟學習這次的調整就好","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:21:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":83,"replies":4,"reposts":4,"shares":17},"score":103,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T09:14:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgISGBDD6Bo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgISGBDD6Bo","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"安裝教學連結：\ncanva.dev/docs…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:31:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T09:14:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHtiBSlG-s","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHtiBSlG-s","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Meta Edits 最神的\n當然是內建 MCP 讓 AI 來幫你剪片\n\n除以之外還有很多影片相關功能：\n→ 上字幕、加特效、影片之間的轉場\n→ 4K 匯出沒有浮水印\n→ 內建音樂庫和音效\n→ 支援提詞機錄音跟雙語自動字幕\n→ 連 LUTs 和 Apple Log 還原都能做到\n\n以上這些除了你可以自己調整\nAI 也能直接幫你做完\n\n最後一頁可以看看 AI 自己排完的四軌時間軸\n想試 Mac 免費剪片的話可以直接載來玩玩看！","timestamp":"2026-11-24T10:12:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":81,"replies":2,"reposts":10,"shares":56},"score":115,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHKPGbEdr1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHKPGbEdr1","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google 大佛心\n\n終於把 Carbon 下放給 Pro 用戶了\n而且 Argon 那條獨立的 Usage 也合併\n最近也會沒事就重置一下\n\n至於是否推薦後面黑五直上年繳方案\n我覺得要看你願不願意想花三千塊\n很難保證 Google 是都只會在 Q4 才發力\n還是明年一整年都能維持很有競爭力","timestamp":"2026-11-24T05:03:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":59,"replies":16,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":94,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgFsIqbnwnq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgFsIqbnwnq","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"有生之年還會看到 NVDA 一天漲 33% 嗎","timestamp":"2026-11-23T15:21:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC9dlej6WT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgC9dlej6WT","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"AI 自動化剪片又突破到下一個層級了！\n\n如果你也是無法放心整支影片都給 AI 剪\n現在又多了一個強大的工具可以用\n而且完全免費\n\nMeta Edit 有 MacOS 版本，而且內建 MCP 讓 AI 操作\n所以影片上的動作全部是 Claude 自己做的\n1. 匯入素材\n2. 挑選背景音樂\n3. 逐段加上音效\n4. 還能幫忙設定轉場\n（影片沒有做任何加速）\n\n也就是說 AI 可以照著你想要的方式快速完成初剪\n你再回來做最後的精修跟調整就好","timestamp":"2026-11-22T13:59:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":55,"replies":8,"reposts":9,"shares":50},"score":98,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[{"id":"DgIflVTEpvz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@c.yu.an_/post/DgIflVTEpvz","username":"c.yu.an_","displayName":"c.yu.an_","content":"都不是小伙子了 這種白痴錯誤還是會發生","timestamp":"2026-11-24T17:29:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T09:14:46+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DgFzSaplAOx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DgFzSaplAOx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"Rrrrrr! Jensen is back 🥲🥲🥲\n痛哭","timestamp":"2026-11-23T16:23:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-25T01:18:38+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}